Error [jet.StateSectionNotAllowed]: `state { … }` is not valid inside a trait
  --> tests/ui/e0158_state_section_on_trait.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     state { Open }
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: State sections attach only to named struct and enum bodies; traits, aliases, impls, modules, and anonymous shapes have no state-set owner
 Fix: Move `state { … }` into a named struct or enum body
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0158
